 "note": "Chubby candle-newt. A living lantern: lights the area around it so monsters can't spawn there.",
 "ability_desc": "Lantern: once tamed, its flame is a real light. Wherever it is (following or told to stay) it keeps one invisible LIGHT block lit at its feet, so the area is truly lit and hostile mobs cannot spawn within about 8 blocks of it, in caves, indoors and outdoors at night (off in daylight outdoors). The light moves with it; the old one is put out every second, and on death, despawn or reload. Only ever placed into air and only removed if it is still a LIGHT block. Bond: light level 9 + bond (spawn-proof radius about 8 -> 13 blocks).",
